WEBVTT

00:24.896 --> 00:28.000
♪I woke up in a strange place♪

00:31.123 --> 00:34.080
♪The sunlight here is blindingly bright♪

00:37.216 --> 00:40.736
♪Pages rustle, and I hear a loud voice♪

00:42.656 --> 00:47.712
♪I've become the center of the story♪

00:48.608 --> 00:52.978
♪I must escape this dream♪

00:54.560 --> 00:59.160
♪Yet why does my heart
surrender before you♪

01:00.128 --> 01:04.032
♪Clearly, it's a fake plot♪

01:04.352 --> 01:06.528
♪A fake world♪

01:07.232 --> 01:12.224
♪Yet eventually,
my heart is open to you♪

01:37.088 --> 01:40.896
=My Page in the 90s=
(Adapted from "Bye, Wild Weasel")

01:41.000 --> 01:44.158
=Episode 22=

02:00.648 --> 02:01.327
What's wrong?

02:04.447 --> 02:05.048
Nothing.

02:06.727 --> 02:08.207
Could you join me for one more stop?

02:12.368 --> 02:12.808
Okay.

02:21.960 --> 02:25.207
(Forget Me)

02:25.207 --> 02:25.968
Recall this place?

02:30.607 --> 02:31.528
Let's go inside.

02:51.047 --> 02:52.167
Do you remember this flower?

02:57.727 --> 02:58.408
What is it?

03:00.327 --> 03:01.047
Welcome.

03:01.288 --> 03:03.167
Are you two here
to buy flowers or plant some?

03:03.248 --> 03:05.167
Miss, do you remember us?

03:06.927 --> 03:09.167
No, have we met before?

03:09.887 --> 03:10.447
Then...

03:14.047 --> 03:15.088
Whose plant is this?

03:15.688 --> 03:17.487
It was probably left
by a previous customer.

03:17.767 --> 03:19.368
It seems no one ever came to claim it.

03:25.767 --> 03:26.528
I see.

03:28.167 --> 03:29.512
I'd like to plant forget-me-nots.

03:30.167 --> 03:30.767
Okay.

03:30.767 --> 03:31.647
I'll go prepare.

04:23.287 --> 04:25.287
Do you know the symbolism of sunflowers?

04:26.767 --> 04:27.688
Silent love.

04:31.568 --> 04:35.048
I once planted a sunflower
with someone very important to me.

04:37.168 --> 04:38.536
Too bad...

04:41.544 --> 04:43.287
I didn't get his meaning back then.

04:45.887 --> 04:47.087
With so many flowers,

04:47.447 --> 04:49.128
why choose sunflowers?

04:50.048 --> 04:52.847
But I think sunflower symbolism
is more interesting.

04:53.128 --> 04:53.808
What is it?

04:55.928 --> 04:57.967
I should've planted forget-me-nots
from the start.

04:59.647 --> 05:00.767
Their symbolism is better.

05:05.248 --> 05:07.207
All planted. Let's go.

05:11.739 --> 05:14.504
(Forget Me)

05:19.568 --> 05:20.368
Sir.

05:21.327 --> 05:22.688
Two more bottles.

05:22.688 --> 05:23.287
Coming.

05:25.327 --> 05:26.488
Honey, you look great today.

05:26.568 --> 05:27.128
Of course.

05:38.887 --> 05:40.447
Stop looking at me. This is your fault.

05:41.128 --> 05:42.008
If it weren't for you,

05:42.008 --> 05:44.207
would Gao Haiming
have turned into a complete idiot?

05:44.527 --> 05:46.488
Would he have forgotten everything?

05:47.207 --> 05:49.048
I took him to so many places.

05:49.048 --> 05:50.527
We had so many wonderful memories.

05:50.527 --> 05:52.248
Now he doesn't remember any of it.

05:52.248 --> 05:54.168
This is all because of you.

05:59.887 --> 06:00.728
Maybe it's best.

06:03.287 --> 06:04.207
At least this way,

06:05.568 --> 06:08.527
the fondness definitely won't
increase anymore.

06:11.128 --> 06:15.327
Maybe I can stay in this world forever,

06:16.447 --> 06:18.488
silently watching over him.

06:22.128 --> 06:24.407
This is not fair.

06:24.407 --> 06:26.407
I've already pursued him once.

06:26.407 --> 06:29.008
Now I have to pursue him again.

06:29.887 --> 06:31.368
Gao Haiming,

06:32.488 --> 06:35.928
you're incredibly hard to win over.
Don't you know that?

06:44.287 --> 06:45.008
Hallucination.

06:46.368 --> 06:47.048
Go away.

06:47.447 --> 06:48.887
I don't want to see you right now.

06:55.767 --> 06:56.887
Miss, here's your beer.

07:04.048 --> 07:04.728
Stop drinking.

07:12.767 --> 07:14.008
Not a hallucination?

07:15.847 --> 07:17.407
Didn't I tell you to leave?

07:17.568 --> 07:19.207
I don't want to see you right now.

07:20.008 --> 07:21.287
You're telling me what to do?

07:23.087 --> 07:24.488
What gives you the right?

07:25.928 --> 07:27.608
Who are you to tell me what to do?

07:29.728 --> 07:30.887
Yes, you're my boss.

07:32.048 --> 07:33.327
But I'm off work now.

07:33.327 --> 07:34.568
You can't tell me what to do.

07:35.287 --> 07:36.207
A friend?

07:37.087 --> 07:38.967
You don't remember anything as a friend.

07:40.368 --> 07:45.128
So now you're just a kind stranger
meddling in my business.

07:46.248 --> 07:47.368
It's not your business.

08:03.248 --> 08:04.048
Go away.

08:07.928 --> 08:09.048
Either you leave

08:09.488 --> 08:10.767
or stay and drink with me.

08:10.887 --> 08:12.447
If you won't drink, then leave now.

08:29.488 --> 08:30.368
Why are you crying?

08:32.968 --> 08:33.927
I like crying.

08:35.608 --> 08:37.167
I just enjoy crying.

08:38.488 --> 08:39.848
Got a problem with that?

08:45.208 --> 08:49.008
What did you mean earlier
when you said I forgot you?

08:49.647 --> 08:51.407
Let me sober up first.

08:51.527 --> 08:53.088
I'll take you somewhere.

09:16.807 --> 09:17.848
Why did you bring me here?

09:27.767 --> 09:28.608
How did you know?

09:39.687 --> 09:40.584
What are you seeking?

09:42.248 --> 09:44.848
I'm looking
for a painted Wild Weasel aircraft.

09:45.368 --> 09:46.128
What paint scheme?

09:47.567 --> 09:48.687
Multicolored.

09:48.687 --> 09:49.767
With candy designs on it.

09:58.167 --> 09:59.047
You mean this one?

10:03.567 --> 10:04.208
That's it.

10:06.328 --> 10:07.407
Why was it in there?

10:16.287 --> 10:17.008
I don't remember.

10:18.047 --> 10:19.448
I just thought it was special.

10:19.448 --> 10:20.448
So I kept it safe.

10:21.608 --> 10:23.167
Do you recall how it came to be?

10:26.047 --> 10:26.807
(Care to try?)

10:28.088 --> 10:29.047
To paint it?

10:29.608 --> 10:30.527
Forget it.

10:31.767 --> 10:34.488
I'm afraid I might damage it.

10:35.248 --> 10:36.008
Even if it breaks,

10:36.167 --> 10:37.088
it'd still be unique.

10:43.167 --> 10:43.807
I don't.

10:51.368 --> 10:53.368
Then, could you give me this model?

10:55.807 --> 10:56.448
Yes.

10:58.088 --> 10:59.208
But could you tell me

11:00.527 --> 11:02.008
why you know about its existence?

11:05.328 --> 11:06.488
Is it related to you?

11:11.287 --> 11:12.728
I'm not sure how to explain it.

11:15.088 --> 11:16.968
But it really is very important to me.

11:24.527 --> 11:26.488
(Do you know the symbolism
of sunflowers?)

11:28.527 --> 11:29.328
Silent love.

11:29.887 --> 11:33.848
I once planted a sunflower
with someone very important to me.

11:34.887 --> 11:38.368
(Too bad.
I didn't get his meaning back then.)

11:57.488 --> 11:59.407
Luo, can I ask you something?

12:00.887 --> 12:02.968
Do you remember
when Lin Huan'er joined the company?

12:03.647 --> 12:06.328
Lin Huan'er? I hired her.

12:06.488 --> 12:07.608
Before New Year's Day.

12:08.208 --> 12:09.728
I can't remember the exact date.

12:10.088 --> 12:10.927
I'll go check.

12:12.448 --> 12:15.968
Yeah, she seems to have appeared
out of nowhere

12:17.488 --> 12:20.407
and seems to have always been here.

12:21.448 --> 12:22.088
Mr. Gao,

12:22.488 --> 12:24.488
I don't know if I should say this.

12:25.008 --> 12:26.008
Then don't say it.

12:26.448 --> 12:28.368
Are you planning to replace me with her?

12:28.887 --> 12:30.728
Luo, why are you still in the company?

12:31.287 --> 12:32.567
Mr. Gao, that won't do.

12:32.687 --> 12:34.767
My loyalty to the company is absolute.

12:34.848 --> 12:36.008
I work diligently.

12:36.008 --> 12:37.687
You can't just kick the ladder away.

12:44.368 --> 12:47.208
Shouldn't we celebrate
Mr. Gao's birthday grandly?

12:47.647 --> 12:48.287
Agreed.

12:48.927 --> 12:51.248
How about booking 30 tables
at Nebula Hotel?

12:51.608 --> 12:52.687
- I agree.
- Good idea.

12:53.807 --> 12:56.248
Why are you all so excited
about the boss' birthday?

12:56.567 --> 12:57.647
For perks for yourselves?

13:01.687 --> 13:03.567
Mr. Gao never celebrates his birthday.

13:05.448 --> 13:07.647
He always tries to avoid such occasions.

13:08.287 --> 13:09.887
This year he agreed so readily.

13:10.448 --> 13:11.728
It's his first time celebrating.

13:12.807 --> 13:13.767
What if we mess it up?

13:23.887 --> 13:24.527
Wait.

13:26.047 --> 13:26.807
Go back to work.

13:28.807 --> 13:30.696
I didn't hear it. I was just here
to get water.

13:31.088 --> 13:32.088
No one said you did.

13:32.328 --> 13:33.608
Why confess out of the blue?

13:34.968 --> 13:36.728
Well? Any ideas?

13:38.008 --> 13:39.527
We shouldn't do it in a hotel.

13:39.527 --> 13:41.128
And 30 tables are way too grand.

13:41.448 --> 13:43.647
Mr. Gao doesn't like grand occasions.

13:43.647 --> 13:45.047
Especially formal, corporate ones.

13:45.047 --> 13:46.328
Doing it in the office is fine.

13:48.248 --> 13:49.032
You didn't hear us?

13:52.047 --> 13:52.647
By the way,

13:53.128 --> 13:54.128
I've wanted to ask you.

13:55.368 --> 13:57.647
Why do you know
Mr. Gao's preferences so well?

13:59.848 --> 14:00.647
Because

14:02.248 --> 14:03.647
I'm a rather observant person.

14:04.728 --> 14:06.488
Believe me, if you let me handle this,

14:06.488 --> 14:07.728
I can make Mr. Gao happy.

14:10.008 --> 14:10.807
I believe you.

14:12.047 --> 14:12.848
I really do.

14:13.088 --> 14:14.488
If you don't, just let me do it.

14:14.687 --> 14:17.368
If he's not happy,
I'll take the blame. Okay?

14:20.407 --> 14:21.807
Blame isn't the issue.

14:22.167 --> 14:23.287
The key is pleasing Mr. Gao.

14:24.728 --> 14:25.767
You're fully in charge.

14:25.968 --> 14:26.567
Okay.

14:39.048 --> 14:43.767
(Happy Birthday!)

14:43.767 --> 14:44.448
Lin Huan'er.

14:45.728 --> 14:46.527
Everything okay?

15:20.807 --> 15:21.728
- Haiming.
- Mr. Gao.

15:24.368 --> 15:25.167
Why are you here?

15:25.647 --> 15:27.208
I came to give you a birthday gift.

15:30.848 --> 15:32.248
Your father agreed?

15:32.687 --> 15:33.687
He's agreed.

15:34.287 --> 15:36.128
Letao is growing so rapidly now.

15:36.407 --> 15:37.767
Partnering with Letao

15:37.887 --> 15:40.047
is a good thing for Fuchuang too.

15:40.647 --> 15:43.728
We just don't know if you're willing
to give us this chance.

15:44.088 --> 15:45.088
Why wouldn't I?

15:51.448 --> 15:52.887
- So perfect.
- So perfect.

15:53.047 --> 15:53.687
Yeah.

15:53.687 --> 15:56.767
Looks like we'll be attending Mr. Gao
and Miss Xie's wedding soon.

16:03.088 --> 16:03.687
Mr. Gao,

16:04.287 --> 16:05.088
let's cut the cake.

16:06.647 --> 16:07.848
Please help distribute it.

16:08.687 --> 16:11.287
Everyone, thank you
for celebrating my birthday.

16:11.687 --> 16:12.728
After the cake,

16:13.008 --> 16:13.887
take the day off.

16:17.887 --> 16:21.807
Happy birthday, Mr. Gao!

16:22.567 --> 16:24.128
Let's talk in my office.

16:26.888 --> 16:32.801
♪Now I see what passed between us♪

16:34.598 --> 16:37.658
♪Walking through the crowd to meet you♪

16:38.824 --> 16:42.276
♪Going through surging tides of people♪

16:43.272 --> 16:48.798
♪Until the world's end♪

16:51.208 --> 16:55.004
♪If I could♪

16:55.592 --> 16:58.408
♪Keep loving you♪

16:58.408 --> 16:59.432
(Happy birthday. - Huan'er)

16:59.432 --> 17:01.832
♪Hearing two hearts♪

17:01.832 --> 17:06.748
♪Beating together♪

17:07.720 --> 17:11.584
♪If I could♪

17:11.584 --> 17:14.824
♪Stay resting in your arms♪

17:15.880 --> 17:23.205
♪I'd trade the rest of my life for it♪

17:28.367 --> 17:29.567
You sure Lin Huan'er is here?

17:30.527 --> 17:31.448
Yes, boss.

17:31.607 --> 17:33.087
What's the rush to find her?

17:33.087 --> 17:34.408
Your birthday party is still on.

17:45.607 --> 17:46.327
Hello?

17:46.888 --> 17:47.976
Lin Huan'er, where are you?

17:51.287 --> 17:53.408
Mr. Gao, I came out to clear my head.

17:55.607 --> 17:57.807
I wanted to thank you
for the party you threw me.

17:58.527 --> 17:59.287
I love it.

18:02.488 --> 18:03.527
I'm glad you like it.

18:05.367 --> 18:06.448
Happy birthday.

18:09.567 --> 18:10.287
Where are you?

18:13.087 --> 18:13.847
At the beach?

18:15.648 --> 18:18.607
Yes, the same place we visited before.

18:19.087 --> 18:19.728
Forget it.

18:20.488 --> 18:21.408
You wouldn't remember.

18:24.968 --> 18:25.567
Lin Huan'er?

18:26.168 --> 18:27.367
Hello? Lin Huan'er?

18:35.047 --> 18:35.648
Lin Huan'er?

18:36.047 --> 18:37.287
Someone's in the water!

18:38.008 --> 18:39.087
Someone's in the water!

18:39.087 --> 18:40.127
Help!

18:45.208 --> 18:46.807
Someone's drowning! Help!

18:47.168 --> 18:48.168
Someone's in the water!

18:49.767 --> 18:50.847
Can anyone swim?

18:51.607 --> 18:53.127
Someone's in the water! Help!

18:53.127 --> 18:54.087
Who? Who's fallen in?

18:54.087 --> 18:55.208
A young girl.

18:55.208 --> 18:56.248
Quite pretty.

18:56.248 --> 18:57.767
Not sure if she fell in drunk.

18:57.767 --> 18:58.287
No.

18:58.287 --> 18:59.448
She was just on the phone.

18:59.448 --> 19:00.287
Stop talking!

19:00.287 --> 19:01.408
Go help her!

19:01.767 --> 19:02.087
Boss!

19:02.087 --> 19:02.767
I can't swim.

19:02.767 --> 19:03.287
Can you swim?

19:03.287 --> 19:03.968
Boss!

19:25.208 --> 19:26.087
What? What happened?

19:26.087 --> 19:26.888
A woman fell in.

19:26.888 --> 19:27.848
They just got her out.

19:27.928 --> 19:29.047
Then a man jumped in too.

19:29.807 --> 19:30.527
Lin Huan'er.

19:31.208 --> 19:31.968
Mr. Gao jumped in.

19:31.968 --> 19:32.928
He can't swim.

19:55.720 --> 19:58.824
♪I woke up in a strange place♪

20:01.947 --> 20:04.904
♪The sunlight here is blindingly bright♪

20:08.040 --> 20:11.560
♪Pages rustle, and I hear a loud voice♪

20:13.480 --> 20:18.536
♪I've become the center of the story♪

20:19.432 --> 20:23.802
♪I must escape this dream♪

20:25.384 --> 20:29.984
♪Yet why does my heart
surrender before you♪

20:30.952 --> 20:34.856
♪Clearly, it's a fake plot♪

20:35.176 --> 20:37.352
♪A fake world♪

20:38.056 --> 20:43.048
♪Yet eventually,
my heart is open to you♪

20:45.000 --> 20:48.104
♪I woke up in a strange place♪

20:51.227 --> 20:54.184
♪The sunlight here is blindingly bright♪

20:57.320 --> 21:00.840
♪Pages rustle, and I hear a loud voice♪

21:02.760 --> 21:07.816
♪I've become the center of the story♪

21:08.712 --> 21:13.082
♪I must escape this dream♪

21:14.664 --> 21:19.264
♪Yet why does my heart
surrender before you♪

21:19.327 --> 21:20.767
Are you feeling unwell?

21:21.527 --> 21:22.488
Do you need a hospital?

21:25.728 --> 21:26.367
Huan'er,

21:30.527 --> 21:31.688
I really forgot you?

21:35.208 --> 21:36.087
For how long?

21:37.408 --> 21:38.968
It's okay. None of that matters now.

21:40.327 --> 21:41.728
I'm just glad you remember me now.

21:52.008 --> 21:52.807
I'm sorry.

21:54.168 --> 21:56.847
I know these past days
must've been hard for you.

21:57.607 --> 21:58.728
I won't leave you again.

22:25.384 --> 22:29.355
♪Old photos, yellowed♪

22:29.355 --> 22:33.511
♪Timelines, tangled♪

22:36.448 --> 22:37.248
I'm so sorry

22:38.008 --> 22:39.567
you had to go through that.

22:41.160 --> 22:45.128
♪Old times, pass slowly♪

22:45.128 --> 22:49.258
♪In memories, the breeze is soft♪

22:49.896 --> 22:53.866
♪Your smile is shimmering like stars♪

22:53.866 --> 22:59.282
♪Lighting up my lonely corner♪

23:00.502 --> 23:08.056
♪Love's time machine,
flies, flies, flies♪

23:08.056 --> 23:16.070
♪Through centuries, just to meet you♪

23:16.070 --> 23:24.071
♪Love's time machine keeps on turning♪

23:24.071 --> 23:28.424
♪Streaking across the sky♪

23:29.320 --> 23:38.216
♪Just to hold you♪

23:48.008 --> 23:51.816
♪Old times, pass slowly♪

23:51.816 --> 23:56.456
♪In memories, the breeze is soft♪

23:56.456 --> 24:00.648
♪Your smile is shimmering like stars♪

24:00.648 --> 24:05.930
♪Lighting up my lonely corner♪

24:07.351 --> 24:14.979
♪Love's time machine,
flies, flies, flies♪

24:14.981 --> 24:23.004
♪Through centuries, just to meet you♪

24:23.004 --> 24:30.761
♪Love's time machine keeps on turning♪

24:30.761 --> 24:35.847
♪Streaking across the sky♪

24:35.847 --> 24:36.408
You're awake.

24:36.408 --> 24:46.792
♪Just to hold you♪

24:47.208 --> 24:48.208
I'll make breakfast.

25:09.127 --> 25:10.087
System notification:

25:10.327 --> 25:13.008
Male Lead's fondness toward you
has reached 100%.

25:13.408 --> 25:14.688
You're nearing quest completion.

25:15.087 --> 25:16.968
Proceed to complete the final goal

25:17.168 --> 25:18.287
and get his proposal.

25:18.648 --> 25:20.448
May you return
to your original world soon.

25:58.607 --> 25:59.448
Why are you gawking?

26:00.087 --> 26:00.607
Come here.

26:02.527 --> 26:03.127
Sit.

26:07.928 --> 26:08.968
You made all this?

26:11.567 --> 26:13.807
If we could wake up together
and have breakfast

26:13.807 --> 26:14.607
like this every day,

26:14.888 --> 26:15.648
it would be great.

26:19.287 --> 26:19.807
Okay.

26:20.448 --> 26:21.327
If you like it,

26:21.408 --> 26:22.968
I'll cook for you every day.

26:24.488 --> 26:26.728
This happiness
feels so surreal to me now.

26:33.287 --> 26:35.008
Sometimes I think

26:35.928 --> 26:38.168
so many things in this world

26:39.168 --> 26:41.008
seem predestined.

26:43.208 --> 26:43.888
What?

26:44.607 --> 26:45.367
Like this time.

26:46.648 --> 26:48.888
I still can't recall
why I lost my memory,

26:50.087 --> 26:50.847
and coincidentally,

26:51.047 --> 26:52.248
all of it was about you.

26:53.087 --> 26:56.968
And people around us seemed
to have forgotten our relationship too.

26:58.408 --> 27:00.367
As if someone wiped it all away.

27:09.648 --> 27:10.327
It's okay.

27:11.527 --> 27:13.367
So what if it was predestined?

27:13.888 --> 27:15.327
Every story needs its author.

27:16.208 --> 27:17.168
In that case,

27:17.488 --> 27:19.408
let's write ours ourselves.

27:20.008 --> 27:20.567
Okay?

27:27.208 --> 27:28.607
Try my cooking. Here.

27:31.488 --> 27:32.648
Soft-boiled egg.

27:43.888 --> 27:44.527
It's crooked.

27:50.688 --> 27:51.287
There.

27:52.367 --> 27:53.087
Come in with me.

27:53.087 --> 27:53.928
I need to talk.

27:59.087 --> 28:00.688
What's going on?

28:00.847 --> 28:01.847
Am I seeing this right?

28:02.008 --> 28:02.767
I knew it.

28:02.807 --> 28:04.648
I wondered
why Lin Huan'er seemed so sure

28:04.648 --> 28:06.607
about Mr. Gao's preferences
for his birthday.

28:07.248 --> 28:09.408
Turns out
they've been together all along.

28:12.767 --> 28:13.888
They're so open about it,

28:14.408 --> 28:16.208
publicly dating in the office.

28:16.208 --> 28:16.847
Who?

28:18.248 --> 28:19.688
Who dares to have an office romance?

28:20.488 --> 28:21.288
Speak.

28:24.968 --> 28:26.408
Slacking off all day long.

28:28.208 --> 28:29.287
To publish the patent?

28:30.168 --> 28:31.327
Are you sure about this?

28:31.607 --> 28:32.127
Yes.

28:32.327 --> 28:33.087
What do you think?

28:34.087 --> 28:36.287
It can indeed drive the industry forward

28:36.448 --> 28:39.248
and improve the overall quality
of domestic brands.

28:39.888 --> 28:44.168
But this is the result
of your research and effort after all.

28:44.367 --> 28:45.488
Are you ready to let it go?

28:46.087 --> 28:47.168
You doubt my judgment?

28:48.248 --> 28:49.087
Of course I don't.

28:49.928 --> 28:51.408
- I will firmly stand by...
- Boss.

28:52.047 --> 28:54.047
I notice an increase
in office romances recently.

28:54.047 --> 28:55.448
If this goes on, the company...

29:06.488 --> 29:09.047
Will get better and better.

29:11.047 --> 29:11.567
Alright.

29:12.008 --> 29:13.327
I won't disturb your work.

29:13.327 --> 29:14.008
I'll head back.

29:14.008 --> 29:14.888
Wait for you tonight.

29:20.008 --> 29:20.807
Luo,

29:22.567 --> 29:24.287
why are you still in the company?

29:25.688 --> 29:27.488
Boss, I've finished all the patent work.

29:27.807 --> 29:28.767
Let me stay longer.

29:33.327 --> 29:34.248
Make it a big deal.

29:35.527 --> 29:36.087
Okay.

29:37.168 --> 29:38.008
Wait, boss.

29:39.008 --> 29:41.367
When did you two get together?

29:43.767 --> 29:44.807
You didn't know?

29:45.287 --> 29:46.047
I didn't know.

29:49.127 --> 29:51.607
Should I have known?

30:00.367 --> 30:03.408
Do you remember
when she was at Yunsheng?

30:04.488 --> 30:05.127
Yunsheng?

30:06.807 --> 30:07.888
When was she at Yunsheng?

30:10.408 --> 30:13.127
I poached her from Yunsheng
at a high price.

30:14.607 --> 30:16.208
I was the one who brought her in.

30:17.032 --> 30:19.607
Last month, she was transferred
due to marketing staff shortage.

30:19.607 --> 30:21.000
She was working downstairs before.

30:21.367 --> 30:23.248
She moved here after New Year's Eve.

30:23.968 --> 30:25.928
Then after your birthday,

30:26.847 --> 30:27.688
you two...

30:29.688 --> 30:31.248
Boss, you're this.

30:42.567 --> 30:45.087
You are truly
a disgusting and lousy system.

30:45.928 --> 30:47.807
They are all living people.

30:48.248 --> 30:50.888
How can you control everyone's fate?

30:51.047 --> 30:53.008
Even if you think
they are fictional characters,

30:53.208 --> 30:54.807
you can't be this inhumane.

30:55.968 --> 30:56.968
It's so real.

30:58.688 --> 30:59.488
Of course.

31:00.367 --> 31:01.448
Do you think I'm fake?

31:06.168 --> 31:07.567
Of course, you're not fake.

31:09.367 --> 31:11.767
(You are a real person
who exists in this world.)

31:20.104 --> 31:21.928
(Breaking: Letao Group Freely
Releases Patents Industry-Wide)

31:21.928 --> 31:24.127
Independent R&amp;D
has always been my dream.

31:24.367 --> 31:26.208
And I believe
Letao can definitely achieve it.

31:26.488 --> 31:28.488
I aim to elevate
domestic product standards

31:28.968 --> 31:31.008
and make affordable,
high-quality products.

31:31.807 --> 31:33.408
Happy New Year. Your car keys.

31:33.968 --> 31:34.688
Happy New Year.

31:36.648 --> 31:39.408
Since your parents haven't returned,

31:39.767 --> 31:41.488
how about spending the New Year
at my place?

31:42.607 --> 31:43.807
I have work that day.

31:44.367 --> 31:45.847
No break during the New Year?

31:46.127 --> 31:47.087
It can't be helped.

31:48.567 --> 31:49.287
Okay.

31:58.327 --> 32:00.688
(Haiming, well done.)

32:02.087 --> 32:04.767
(I really should have trusted
your judgment earlier.)

32:05.767 --> 32:08.448
(Letao's future is in your hands.)

32:18.208 --> 32:20.327
(Thanks, Dad.)

32:26.367 --> 32:27.327
Chairman Gao?

32:29.248 --> 32:29.968
Yes.

32:30.928 --> 32:33.287
It's the first time in so many years
he's acknowledged me.

32:35.567 --> 32:36.327
Congratulations.

32:37.448 --> 32:40.127
The ambitions and aspirations
you spoke of back then

32:40.968 --> 32:43.127
are coming true step by step now.

32:49.408 --> 32:50.047
Huan'er,

32:50.807 --> 32:52.728
people are always greedy.

32:53.367 --> 32:54.527
Now I have a new wish.

32:55.688 --> 32:56.408
What is it?

32:59.567 --> 33:00.807
Let's go. I'll take you home.

33:02.047 --> 33:02.567
No need.

33:02.928 --> 33:03.888
I'll go back by myself.

33:04.367 --> 33:05.928
Didn't you schedule to meet someone?

33:06.367 --> 33:08.087
I won't add to your busy schedule.

33:08.527 --> 33:09.327
I'll take you home.

33:09.327 --> 33:10.408
Really, no need.

33:10.847 --> 33:12.087
I can go back by myself.

33:12.728 --> 33:13.728
You go ahead.

33:32.367 --> 33:33.127
Happy New Year.

33:34.847 --> 33:35.648
Happy New Year.

33:36.087 --> 33:37.287
Text me when you get home.

33:39.168 --> 33:39.767
Bye.

33:52.968 --> 33:55.127
Even the carrier sent me a message.

33:56.008 --> 33:58.008
Why didn't he send a message
during the New Year?

33:58.488 --> 34:00.607
Isn't this too cold?

34:01.287 --> 34:02.367
Put your phone down.

34:02.367 --> 34:03.448
Help me hang this.

34:03.448 --> 34:04.127
I can't do it.

34:04.127 --> 34:05.248
I'm busy.

34:05.448 --> 34:06.127
Please.

34:06.127 --> 34:07.287
Come on.

34:09.488 --> 34:11.087
You're grown up now, okay?

34:11.167 --> 34:11.687
Give it here.

34:14.087 --> 34:15.488
Huan'er, something's off with you.

34:17.247 --> 34:18.567
Who are you texting?

34:19.087 --> 34:20.687
Are you dating someone again?

34:22.808 --> 34:23.687
You're such an expert.

34:23.727 --> 34:25.087
I am always an expert.

34:26.888 --> 34:28.928
Girls, come look at this.

34:29.047 --> 34:30.607
See what I brought back.

34:30.928 --> 34:31.687
It smells terrible.

34:31.888 --> 34:32.768
That's not true.

34:32.848 --> 34:33.687
It smells terrible.

34:33.687 --> 34:34.687
But it tastes delicious.

34:34.808 --> 34:35.888
It tastes terrible too.

34:36.647 --> 34:37.768
I'll hang it up.

34:39.408 --> 34:40.448
Our family is doomed.

34:40.647 --> 34:42.047
Yeah, it's too smelly.

34:43.488 --> 34:44.207
Who is it?

34:47.687 --> 34:48.488
Happy New Year.

34:49.488 --> 34:50.448
Gao Haiming?

34:51.607 --> 34:52.567
Why are you here?

34:53.047 --> 34:53.607
Take a guess.

34:53.607 --> 34:55.008
Didn't you have other plans?

34:58.247 --> 34:58.848
Le'er.

35:00.207 --> 35:01.368
My boyfriend.

35:05.167 --> 35:05.808
Here we go.

35:14.087 --> 35:15.247
Huan'er, not bad.

35:15.368 --> 35:16.288
You're pleased?

35:16.848 --> 35:17.687
How do you know?

35:18.207 --> 35:20.527
Girls, girls, come quick.

35:20.527 --> 35:21.968
Hello, sir.

35:22.047 --> 35:23.008
I'm Gao Haiming,

35:23.087 --> 35:23.968
Huan'er's boyfriend.

35:31.872 --> 35:34.855
♪Entwined worries linger♪

35:36.064 --> 35:38.835
♪My heart is not empty,
yet pain remains♪

35:40.736 --> 35:46.649
♪Now I see what passed between us♪

35:48.446 --> 35:51.506
♪Walking through the crowd to meet you♪

35:52.672 --> 35:56.124
♪Going through surging tides of people♪

35:57.120 --> 36:02.646
♪Until the world's end♪

36:05.056 --> 36:08.852
♪If I could♪

36:09.440 --> 36:12.256
♪Keep loving you♪

36:13.280 --> 36:15.680
♪Hearing two hearts♪

36:15.680 --> 36:20.596
♪Beating together♪

36:21.568 --> 36:25.432
♪If I could♪

36:25.432 --> 36:28.672
♪Stay resting in your arms♪

36:29.728 --> 36:37.053
♪I'd trade the rest of my life for it♪

